{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397271-has-anyone-homebrewed-a-strong-kraken-or-leviathan","id":1397271,"title":"Has Anyone homebrewed a strong Kraken or Leviathan?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-18T05:08:45-07:00","id":1397271,"title":"Has Anyone homebrewed a strong Kraken or Leviathan?","content":"My game of 2 years is coming to an end this week, and I want to include a Kraken in the Naval Combat portion, but the published Armored Kraken is pretty tame. I am playing with an Essence 3 Sail Supernal with an Artifact ship, so I want something beefy. <br /> <br /> If no Kraken/Leviathan, than any other terrifying Sea battle thing can work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-18T06:02:14-07:00","id":1397278,"title":"","content":"I have not, but I've thought about it a bit.<br /> <br /> In addition to the numbers, I'm confused about how the Armored Kraken is supposed to work. Specifically, it has all these abilities that assume that after grabbing a ship, it will stay in naval combat, doing damage over time. But it seems like, in almost any gameplay situation with players involved, the people on the ship will want to enter ordinary combat to attack the arms. Since there's no time conversion between ordinary combat and naval combat, it's not clear how or if most of its powers can be used in that situation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25834-habitableexoplanet","name":"habitableexoplanet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"296"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-18T07:36:38-07:00","id":1397290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397271-has-anyone-homebrewed-a-strong-kraken-or-leviathan#post1397271\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My game of 2 years is coming to an end this week, and I want to include a Kraken in the Naval Combat portion, but the published Armored Kraken is pretty tame. I am playing with an Essence 3 Sail Supernal with an Artifact ship, so I want something beefy.<br /> <br /> If no Kraken/Leviathan, than any other terrifying Sea battle thing can work.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you looked at the magma walker thing? I'd figure splicing it with bits of the Armored Kraken would get you a suitably biblical Leviathan.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-19T04:03:50-07:00","id":1397490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1397271-has-anyone-homebrewed-a-strong-kraken-or-leviathan?p=1397290#post1397290\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Have you looked at the magma walker thing? I'd figure splicing it with bits of the Armored Kraken would get you a suitably biblical Leviathan.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd really appreciate the name of whatever it is you are talking about. I tried to search it on Drive thru and couldnt find it","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Me